<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Hologic upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Hologic upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst Benjamin Rooks said he upgraded Hologic Inc to focus buy from buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the manufacturer of bone density testing machines were up 5/8 to 21-3/4.</p>
<p>--&quot;Hologic shares have continued to fall with absolutely no fundamental reason for the decline,&quot; Rooks said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
